  "abstract": "Add a small MoT head: a shared horizon basis B\u2208R^{R\u00d732} (R=4) and per-neuron soft assignments P\u2208R^{N\u00d7R} (sum-to-one via softmax), yielding an additive residual y_resid[b,t,n]=\u03b1\u00b7\u2211_r B[r,t]\u00b7P[n,r]. This tests whether structured neuron heterogeneity helps the simple ScalarRamp baseline without changing the main loss (MAE+curvature).",
